*                   R9(TABLE AND BACK) - ADDRESS OF NUMBERS AND FIELD * 21300002
*                                        ALSO USED AS A RETURN ADDRESS* 21350002
*                                        REGISTER FOR BAL WITHIN      * 21400002
*                                        TESTEXIT                     * 21450002
*                   R10(BASE) - BASE REGISTER                         * 21500002
*                   R11(BASE2) - BASE REGISTER                        * 21550002
*                   R12(WORK) - WORK REGISTER                         * 21600002
*                   R13(SAVEREG) - ADDRESS OF SAVE                    * 21650002
*                   R14 - USED BY MACROS                              * 21700002
*                   R15 - USED BY MACROS                              * 21750002
*                   R0 - USED BY MACROS                               * 21800002
* OUTPUT - 1. OPENADDR CONTAINS THE ADDRESS OF THE OPEN DCB FOR THE   * 21850002
*             EXIT CALLING SECTION TO USE.                            * 21900002
*          2. SWITCH CONTAINS A X'01' IF THE RECORD FORMAT FOR THE    * 21950002
*             OUTPUT DATA SET FROM DG IS FIXED. AND IN THIS CASE,     * 22000002
*             FLRECL CONTAINS THE LOGICAL RECORD LENGTH.              * 22050002
*          3. R7(CNT1) - CONTAINS THE ADDRESS OF TESTEXIT'S WORK AREA * 22100002
